{
    "_notes": "Sensirion SHTC3 at 0x70 (fixed - also GravityO2's address and a common multiplexer address). Detection: wake-up (0x3517, harmless when awake, needed if left asleep), then the ID register (0xEFC8): bit 11 = 1 and bits 5-0 = 000111, with a valid CRC. Init: wake-up. Poll: measure, normal mode, T first, no clock stretching (0x7866), 13 ms (max 12.1 ms; the pause bars the address), then read 6 bytes: T_MSB,T_LSB,T_CRC,RH_MSB,RH_LSB,RH_CRC. T = -45 + 175*raw/2^16, RH = 100*raw/2^16.",
    "addresses": "0x70",
    "detectionValues": "0x3517=p1&0xefc8=p1&=0bXXXX1XXXXX000111XXXXXXXX:crc8w",
    "initValues": "0x3517=p1",
    "pollInfo": {
        "c": "0x7866=p13&=r6",
        "i": 5000,
        "s": 1
    },
    "scanPriority": "high",
    "devInfoJson": {
        "name": "Temperature & Humidity Sensor",
        "desc": "",
        "manu": "Sensirion",
        "type": "SHTC3",
        "clas": ["TEMP","RH"],
        "resp": {
            "b": 6,
            "a": [
                {
